petrus-telemetry-instrumentation
Copyright 2026 Seasoned

This package is a Haskell port of the reference's telemetry instrumentation
tests (tests/petrus/telemetry/test_telemetry_instrumentation.py); it holds
no library, only that evidence and a benchmark from Petrus
(https://github.com/henriquebastos/petrus), pinned under upstream/petrus
(see UPSTREAM.md at the repository root). It reproduces the observable
behaviour of that reference, and its test suite ports the reference's tests
and runs differential checks against it.

